kgsl (1.0.4-0qli3) forky; urgency=medium

  [ Loïc Minier ]
  * d/install: rename to kgsl-dkms.install
  * d/kgsl-dkms.postinst: drop extra dkms check; there was a typo in this code
    anyway; return to normal DKMS behavior.

  [ Alexis Cellier ]
  * debian/control: remove useless linux-headers-generic Recommends;
    this is not portable between and Debian and Ubuntu and hardcodes a
    specific kernel flavor.
  * debian: use /usr/share/initramfs-tool/hooks instead of interfering
    with global files in /etc.
  * debian: remove manual initramfs-update calls which are already
    generated by dh_dkms
  * debian: remove kgsl-dkms.service; already loaded through modprobe.d
    files.

